+/// are published known-answer vectors (FIPS-197 AES-128, RFC 4493 AES-CMAC); the seal case is
+/// a live round-trip; the rest pin wire layout and EDID parsing that have no hardware oracle.
+#[kunit_tests(vino_protocol)]
+mod tests {
